rage</strong> souls and power your progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037650/extras/aebaa32471cd851fdfa5c1d15a52fb91.avif?t=1748938625\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037650/extras/db2d3ac32063d41923c1b0a651d1fbdb.poster.avif?t=1748938625\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037650/extras/db2d3ac32063d41923c1b0a651d1fbdb.webm?t=1748938625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make <strong>friends</strong> to aid your journey</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your sanctuary to find <strong>peace</strong> and a place you can call <strong>home</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
